  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You reach across dimensions to call your allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Summon Star-Spawn<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use a summon monster spell or spell-like ability to summon a creature with the alien template or that is one of the star-spawn listed for the feat, you add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to your caster level. In addition, you can expend mythic power to cast any summon monster spell you know as a mythic spell, as long as you summon creatures with the alien template or creatures listed for this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-mythos-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
